Complete the public course from chemical technology/plant language through natural and synthetic manufacturing families. Read the full oils/fats, soaps/detergents, carbohydrates, fermentation, pulp/paper, petroleum, petrochemical, and polymer-related teaching, with its reaction/flow and process-economics questions. Compare actual chemical selectivity, isolation, utilities, and product requirements across these families.

